[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     57[0m:[38;5;10m[49m # Build the list of combos to test. With no declared features the only
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     58[0m:[38;5;10m[49m # meaningful configurations are the default build and --no-default-features.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m COMBOS=()
